<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Vietnamese (vi) for :feature:home. Mirrors values/strings.xml key for key.

  WORDING BAN (LLM.md §1, §5; docs/screens/11-home.md §4.2) carries into every locale. Every string
  below names a capability or reports a measurement; none claims an outcome, and the one percentage
  on this page is storage occupancy — a measurement of how full the volume is.

  Two distinctions the English file insists on and this file keeps:
    * home_junk_not_measured ("chưa kiểm tra") vs home_junk_none ("không tìm thấy") — "we have not
      looked" and "there is nothing" must not read the same in any locale.
    * home_value_unknown stays the honest rendering of null. It is a resource so a translator may
      change it; two hyphens read the same in Vietnamese, so it is unchanged here.

  PLURALS — Vietnamese has one CLDR category, `other`.
-->
